{"total_count":4,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/pull/1","id":5798549303,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTf84yc8AAAABHx4zhQ","number":1,"title":"Create a standalone machine economy ecosystem atlas","user":{"login":"alexart2025","id":203622159,"node_id":"U_kgDODCMHDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203622159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025","html_url":"https://github.com/alexart2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-11T06:15:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T19:18:03Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T19:17:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/pulls/1","html_url":"https://github.com/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/pull/1.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The user site currently redirects visitors to the old ecosystem map. This replaces that redirect with a standalone machine economy atlas and gives AICOM a clear role as the product factory alongside AIMarket and the wider infrastructure.\n\nThe site includes a self-hosted Three.js orbital illustration, a filterable directory of nine projects, an explanation of service exchange, and static English, Russian, Spanish, French and Chinese pages. Subcontracting copy describes the current opt-in diagnostic integration and its provider requirements. It does not present the illustration as live telemetry.\n\nAll content and links work without JavaScript; the scene has a CSS fallback, reduced-motion support, pause and offscreen suspension. Fonts and Three.js are local, with its license retained. Canonical URLs, hreflang, social metadata, sitemap and robots.txt are included. The source remains mirrored from `alexar76/aicom/scripts/github-io/`.\n\nValidation: `python3 build.py`, `python3 validate.py`, JavaScript syntax checks and mirror secret scan pass. Browser checks covered desktop/mobile rendering, French/Russian switching, the trust-category filter (four results) and rendered WebGL. Real HTTP checks returned 200 for all five localized pages and the nine public project/generator destinations tested.\n\nThis PR does not deploy the factory homepage. Merging into this repository's existing `main` Pages source will replace only its root site; project Pages remain separate.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.github.io/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexar76/alexar76.githu